  {
   "x": 6,
   "y": 1,
   "text": "Dingle harbour is sheltered by the hills of the Dingle Peninsula, and for decades a bottlenose dolphin called Fungie met the boats at its mouth. He vanished in 2020 and the town still talks about him.",
